{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting started","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for its keys, a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for what it holds, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", at the release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose documentation you’re reading. In "},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"<version>\")"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links a binary framework, "},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which SwiftPM checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Register the wallet","anchor":"Register-the-wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s Info.plist ("},{"code":"CFBundleURLTypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and pass the URL the app receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the issuance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates: "},{"code":"issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for credentials, and "},{"code":"verifierRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because it sent the offer."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Provide the keys and the storage","anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key — the one a credential copy is bound to — signs when presenting, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Credential Request’s proof when receiving or refreshing. By default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode each time: add an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" describes the trade-off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". The app and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension then share one store: a store of your own implements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" atomically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"across both processes, as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does with a file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lock."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s talking to your genuine app."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"type":"text","text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" error; any other is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Create the wallet","anchor":"Create-the-wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create one "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle of leaves its keys behind. Each trust role whose roots you set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"needs a revocation choice: checked against the CRLs your app fetches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), or declined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"); see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, crls: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots,","            crls: crls,","            revocation: [.issuer, .status, .verifier])","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Ship the release build","anchor":"Ship-the-release-build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app must never have; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says which one an app has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","isActive":true}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable."}],"title":"network","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A store in the app group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":"’s container"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its extensions listing the group in their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.application-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement share."}],"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inAppGroup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","text":"Options"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"title":"Wallet","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/noRevocationCheck":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/norevocationcheck","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The trust roles that decline checking revocation, as an explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"choice: only where something else stands in for it, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates too short-lived to be worth revoking. A role can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in both this and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"noRevocationCheck","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noRevocationCheck"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV14RevocationRoleO","text":"RevocationRole"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore\/compareandswap(id:expected:record:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces the record under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"record"},{"type":"text","text":" — or deletes it, when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"record"},{"type":"text","text":" is nil — only if what’s stored there is, byte for byte,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expected"},{"type":"text","text":" (nil: no record), and returns what was stored before,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether or not it replaced it."}],"title":"compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"compareAndSwap"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"expected"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"record"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/IntegrationChecklist":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/integrationchecklist","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every step and rule for integrating OID4VCWallet, in order, each with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how to check it."}],"title":"Integration checklist","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"title":"WalletConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/revocation":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/revocation","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The trust roles whose certificate chains must pass a CRL check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"crls"},{"type":"text","text":". A role listed fails closed for any CA it has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current CRL from, until "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.setCRLs(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" supplies one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Outside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"type":"text","text":", each role whose roots are set must be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listed here or in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":", or the wallet isn’t made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"title":"revocation","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"revocation"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV14RevocationRoleO","text":"RevocationRole"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helps without personal data."}],"title":"Handling errors","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"title":"Receiving credentials","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"title":"FileCredentialStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, as an iOS document provider."}],"title":"Presenting to Safari","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4V